# Ecrire l'histoire de 'independantisme quebecois'

Jean-Philippe Carlos

Universite York

###### Resume

Cet article propose de jeter un premier regard synthetique sur les tendances historiographiques et interpretatives qu'ont mises de l'avant les praticiens ayant eeuvre ahistorisation du mouvement independantiste contemporain, de la fin des annees 1960 aux premieres decennies des annees 2000. Lauteur met en lumiere la maniere dont les specialistes ont interprete le deploiement de l'idee independantiste dans le contexte de la modernisation culturelle et socioeconomic de la societe quebecoise, mais aussi les approches methodologiques privilegeies ayant servi a etudier les principaux regroupements independantistes du cycle politique 1945-1995.

This article proposes to take a first synthetic look at the historiographical and interpretative trends that have been put forward by practitioners who worked to historicise the contemporary independence movement, from the late 1960s to the first decades of the 2000s. The author highlights how scholars have interpreted the deployment of the independence idea in the context of the cultural and socio-economic modelisation of Quebec society, but also the methodological approaches favoured to study the main independence groups.

